{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c76665f6a8622cd5498ac141d18ccba585422a150dec0b8d9e1b1f6fabcb4446", "ja": "（今日は、雪歩たちがCMをしたコスメブランドの\nキャンペーンイベントだ。そろそろ出番だけど……）", "zh": "（今天是雪步她们广告代言的化妆品品牌的宣传活动。\n差不多要正式上场了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fee74dba012853d6303553c91778cd71584dc60d8cb57fbbff97092c0b4415bb", "ja": "{$P$}、た、大変ですぅ～！", "zh": "{$P$}，不、不好了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cd7fe3cc11c8d0dc30b38c2d3495c75087be208a21083c70e0fac6084e8a9e22", "ja": "どうした、雪歩。なにか問題でもあったのか。", "zh": "怎么了，雪步？有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8125c0f61ad10d39fe7115434638ebc13496bb6a76cee70b18b1cc1e7363270f", "ja": "あ、あの……さっき、会場を見てきたら、\nお客さんがすっごくたくさん集まってたんですぅ……。", "zh": "那、那个……我刚才去看了会场，\n结果聚集了好多好多的观众……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6b9edf232cd3c208ca992a5c5f957823815da577e8101a76045b67096fe0202c", "ja": "ああ、雪歩たちのCMが評判良くて、\n今日のイベントも、話題になってたからな……。", "zh": "是啊，因为雪步你们的广告大受好评，\n而今天的活动也蔚为话题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9e5247ecec01f5ad983b757d53f5e1076f3cc84df5cbda0f3e79d2b60160e149", "ja": "たくさん見に来てくれたのは、\nいいことなんじゃないかな？", "zh": "有很多人来看，\n不是很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b30dcde5d6316d5f5759f1d4fa43710b13494664fa1562c6272ce0db70f4c1c5", "ja": "そ、そうなんですけど、\nステージと客席がすごく近くって……。", "zh": "是、是这样没错，\n不过舞台跟观众席的距离好近……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8256e0aad82f2f711ece468179cf7dc5751b54cd476a6bd038f558dac524e777", "ja": "今から、あそこに立ってしゃべらないといけないって\n思ったら……き、緊張してしまって……。", "zh": "一想到待会要站在那里说话，\n我就……好、好紧张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1008_p", "source_sha256": "41c7346385c323cd5315f3d66fd53bded31816bebe96a698bf94f3cd5b7833e9", "ja": "そういえば、予想以上に人が集まったから、\n急遽、客席を広くして前に寄せたって言ってたな……。", "zh": "说到这个，主办方的确有说，因为人潮比预期的多，\n所以紧急追加观众席，把位子往前靠了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c591630b0cbcdb73c9005ffb10cf37ccdc09f387a59c1496e7fff0861c7ad991", "ja": "それで、雪歩はどうしたい？　スタッフにお願いして、\n客席の位置を下げてもらおうか？", "zh": "那雪步你希望怎么做？\n要不要我去请工作人员把观众席往后移？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9f13c3477124c4b4696936dbade605fa13d7f41ed2fccea9e1dc04388ba429e9", "ja": "えっ？　でも、そんなことしたら、\n見れなくなっちゃう人が出ちゃうんですよね……？", "zh": "咦？可是那么做的话，\n就会有人看不到了对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9569ce83ab6e00e2f584bbda4a89f34addba53a789a0d693b04fa6a1a99949dd", "ja": "せっかく、私達を見に来てくれたのに……。", "zh": "大家特地来看我们的说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7b9349d9fb9da7de73ae31e8b42a616d4a9dd2cbf75daf13d6308226d95558e3", "ja": "{$P$}、わ、私、\nこのままで大丈夫です。が、頑張って行って来ます。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n就、就保持原样，我不要紧的。我、我会加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1013_p", "source_sha256": "81e247ffda0d9af7090bc97ea51618c273898019324469fd6e8604e658a997f5", "ja": "そうか、よかったよ。\nじゃあ、もう時間だから、準備をしておこうか。", "zh": "这样啊，太好了。\n那时间也到了，先准备一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1283e6362c22dcf08bea1e7eeaa93858e7552a9ebd379f3c85c4955745478c32", "ja": "はい。お、男の人が目の前に来ても\n緊張しないように、き、気合を入れていきますぅ。", "zh": "好的，我、我会鼓起干劲，\n就、就算有男生来到我面前，我也不会紧张的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1015_p", "source_sha256": "aebe9de0d97cdd78aff3a556424e479c5242bfbc5d0a0e7e359263e63ab0f3e6", "ja": "男の人……？　ああ……すまない、雪歩。伝えて\nなかったかな……今日は女性限定のイベントなんだ。", "zh": "男生……？啊……抱歉，雪步。\n我是不是没跟你说……今天的活动仅限女性参加。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dfe1fdf67e0bb60ec784788058c4817dd722e3f6ec24b9ee7c762ed7a4964e98", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうなんですか？", "zh": "咦？是、是这样子吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b2e13a6cb527d6cdad8a49d39cf0cf9f7055064b0e15927a43241209cfc20bcf", "ja": "コスメのイベントだからな……。", "zh": "毕竟是化妆品的活动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ccb2dd2ca4ecf0b7c68a2d6dee69f615a73871efbfa684cfb7d378a69792f75e", "ja": "ショップには、雪歩たちの載ったパンフレット\n目当てで、男性客も集まったそうだけど。", "zh": "不过听说有不少男性客人莅临门市，\n就为了拿印有雪步你们照片的宣传册。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1019_004yuk", "source_sha256": "a71d97cfde202fe05bef18240a1f52a92cf3938a87f0706474ddf619a738b966", "ja": "そうなんだ……えへへっ。\nちょっとだけ、気持ちが楽になりました。", "zh": "原来是这样……嘿嘿！\n我的心情有轻松一点了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1020_p", "source_sha256": "641186d431783dc701554d77ba0f2cf21fb5041458a36521118051c3b335c363", "ja": "それはよかった。……でも、油断しないで、\n適度な緊張感をもって、ステージに立とうな。", "zh": "那就好……但是，不可以松懈，\n要带着适度的紧张感登上舞台喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0133_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0133_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "09f951a3c1e3030cbeb2accff0121a658bf5298dfd737385810f3f04fab720ff", "ja": "はいっ！　来てくれた人に楽しんでもらえるように\n頑張ってきますぅ！", "zh": "好的！\n我会努力让来参加活动的人看得开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
